    "sites/north/distribution/sw-north-dist-01" [shape=box3d, fillcolor="#dcf0dc", color="#16a34a", tooltip="sw-north-dist-01 [switch]\nnamespace: sites/north/distribution\nDistribution switch for the North campus. It aggregates the access-layer trunks, hosts the SVI gateway for every campus VLAN, and reaches the core router over a routed (untagged) fibre uplink.\nlabels: env=prod, role=distribution, site=north\nrouter id 10.1.0.2\nospf area 0.0.0.0 on Ethernet52/1, Vlan10, Vlan20\nvrfs: mgmt (rd 65001:99)\nroutes (2):\n  0.0.0.0/0 via 10.1.0.1 dev Ethernet52/1 metric 10\n  0.0.0.0/0 blackhole vrf mgmt\nvlans: 1,10,20,30,99\ninterfaces (8):\n  br0  bridge\n  Vlan10  vlan  10.1.10.1/24, 2001:db8:1:10::1/64  vlan 10 (access)\n  Vlan20  vlan  10.1.20.1/24, 2001:db8:1:20::1/64  vlan 20 (access)\n  Vlan99  vlan  10.1.99.1/24  vlan 99 (access)\n  Ethernet49/1  ethernet  vlan 1,10,20,30,99 (trunk)  00:1c:73:01:d0:01\n  Ethernet50/1  ethernet  vlan 1,10,20,30,99 (trunk)  00:1c:73:01:d0:02\n  Ethernet51/1  ethernet  vlan 1,10,20,30,99 (trunk)  00:1c:73:01:d0:03\n  Ethernet52/1  ethernet  10.1.0.2/30, 2001:db8:1::2/64  00:1c:73:01:d0:04\nlinks (1):\n  Ethernet52/1 — sites/north/core/rtr-north-core-01:xe-0/0/0  (ospf)", label=<
